A header template is instantiated in two translation units, a conversion operator returns a
different type in each: the rewritten header is shared, it must keep the type of both. No cast fits
both, the mutants of the conversion are left out. Every mutant is listed in the sources under its
line, the IR: ones exist only in the IR-mutated program.

RUN: rm -rf %S/Output && mkdir -p %S/Output/sandbox
RUN: cp %S/unwrap.h %S/narrow.cpp %S/wide.cpp %S/tests.cpp %S/mull.yml %S/Output/sandbox/
RUN: cd %S/Output/sandbox && %clang_cxx %sysroot -O0 -g -grecord-command-line %pass_mull_ir_frontend -c narrow.cpp -o %S/Output/narrow.o
RUN: cd %S/Output/sandbox && %clang_cxx %sysroot -O0 -g -grecord-command-line %pass_mull_ir_frontend -c wide.cpp -o %S/Output/wide.o
RUN: cd %S/Output/sandbox && %clang_cxx %sysroot -O0 -c tests.cpp -o %S/Output/tests.o
RUN: %clang_cxx %sysroot %S/Output/narrow.o %S/Output/wide.o %S/Output/tests.o -o %S/Output/ir.exe

RUN: cd %S/Output/sandbox && %mull_runner --dry-run --allow-surviving --reporters SQLite --report-dir %S/Output --report-name dry %S/Output/ir.exe
RUN: echo '[{"directory": "%S/Output/sandbox", "file": "narrow.cpp", "command": "%clang_cxx %sysroot -c narrow.cpp"}, {"directory": "%S/Output/sandbox", "file": "wide.cpp", "command": "%clang_cxx %sysroot -c wide.cpp"}]' > %S/Output/sandbox/compile_commands.json
RUN: %mull_rewriter --report %S/Output/dry.sqlite -p %S/Output/sandbox --root %S/Output/sandbox --output-dir %S/Output/rewritten | %filecheck %s --check-prefix=REWRITER
REWRITER-DAG: Not rewritten (no source equivalent): cxx_replace_scalar_call_nz:{{.*}}unwrap.h:7:18
REWRITER-DAG: Not rewritten (no source equivalent): cxx_replace_scalar_call_zr:{{.*}}unwrap.h:7:18
REWRITER: Rewrote 4 of 6 mutants in 2 files
The header is not rewritten, the rewritten sources include the original
RUN: %clang_cxx %sysroot -O0 -I %S/Output/sandbox %S/Output/rewritten/narrow.cpp %S/Output/rewritten/wide.cpp %S/Output/tests.o -o %S/Output/rewritten.exe

With no mutant on, the rewritten program behaves as the original
RUN: %S/Output/ir.exe
RUN: %S/Output/rewritten.exe

RUN: cd %S/Output/sandbox && %mull_runner -allow-surviving -minimum-timeout 2000 -reporters=IDE -ide-reporter-show-killed %S/Output/ir.exe > %S/Output/ir.txt
RUN: cd %S/Output/sandbox && %mull_runner -allow-surviving -minimum-timeout 2000 -reporters=IDE -ide-reporter-show-killed %S/Output/rewritten.exe > %S/Output/rewritten.txt
RUN: grep unwrap.h: %S/Output/ir.txt | %filecheck %S/unwrap.h --check-prefix=IR --implicit-check-not=warning:
RUN: grep narrow.cpp: %S/Output/ir.txt | %filecheck %S/narrow.cpp --implicit-check-not=warning:
RUN: grep wide.cpp: %S/Output/ir.txt | %filecheck %S/wide.cpp --implicit-check-not=warning:
RUN: ! grep unwrap.h: %S/Output/rewritten.txt
RUN: grep narrow.cpp: %S/Output/rewritten.txt | %filecheck %S/narrow.cpp --implicit-check-not=warning:
RUN: grep wide.cpp: %S/Output/rewritten.txt | %filecheck %S/wide.cpp --implicit-check-not=warning:
